# Populated shelf after `kobo frame init --sim` and `kobo frame push … --sim`.
# The photograph is the panel inside a narrow mat: no caption, no buttons and
# no bar until somebody asks. The sides turn it, which is how it is waited for.
expect-missing Your frame is empty
expect-missing kobo frame
wait-for-id next
wait-idle
expect-missing Photographs
expect-missing Open
clean
shot photo
# The middle says what the photograph is, and leads to Settings.
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Taken
expect Photo 1 of 1
clean
shot details
tap Settings
wait-for Change the photo every
expect Frame mode
expect Slow slideshow
expect Photos come in date order.
clean
shot settings
tap 5 minutes
tap Back
wait-for-id next
expect-missing Change the photo every
expect-missing Taken
# The overlay names the photo and says its bytes match what was pushed.
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Taken
expect File
expect sample-photo.jpg
expect Verified against the manifest
# The cross closes the overlay and leaves the photograph where it was.
tap-at 942,543
wait-idle
expect-missing Taken
wait-for-id next
# A second push while Frame is open is seen when the reader comes back to it.
companion frame push scripts/fixtures/frame/lighthouse.jpg --album Coast --sim
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-idle
wait-for-id next
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Photo 1 of 2
tap-at 942,543
wait-idle
# The right side turns to the next photo, the left side back again.
tap-id next
wait-idle
wait-for-id next
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Photo 2 of 2
expect lighthouse.jpg
expect Coast
clean
shot details-second
tap-at 942,543
wait-idle
tap-id previous
wait-idle
wait-for-id next
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Photo 1 of 2
expect sample-photo.jpg
tap-at 942,543
wait-idle
# Turning past the last photo comes round to the first.
tap-id previous
wait-idle
wait-for-id next
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Photo 2 of 2
tap-at 942,543
wait-idle
# A photo removed from the computer leaves the frame, even the one showing.
companion frame rm photo-72cbbc7a7a54bc6e --sim
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-idle
wait-for-id next
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Photo 1 of 1
expect sample-photo.jpg
expect-missing lighthouse.jpg
# The slow slideshow offers hours, not minutes, and shuffle changes the order note.
tap Settings
wait-for Change the photo every
tap Slow slideshow
wait-for 24 hours
expect 6 hours
expect-missing 5 minutes
expect-missing 15 minutes
tap 24 hours
tap Shuffle
wait-for Photos come in a random order.
clean
shot settings-slow
# Every choice is kept across a restart of the app.
restart
wait-idle
wait-for-id next
tap Settings
wait-for Change the photo every
expect 24 hours
expect Photos come in a random order.
expect-missing 5 minutes
shot settings-after-restart
# Back in Frame mode the minutes return and the order goes back to dates.
tap Frame mode
wait-for 5 minutes
expect 15 minutes
expect-missing 24 hours
tap Shuffle
wait-for Photos come in date order.
tap Back
wait-for-id next
expect-missing Change the photo every
